Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://lerd.sh
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: lerd
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, podman
Recommends: libayatana-appindicator3-1
Description: Herd-like local PHP development environment
 Lerd runs Nginx, PHP-FPM, and services as rootless Podman containers, with a
 built-in web UI, TUI, CLI, and MCP server. No Docker, no sudo, no system
 pollution.
 .
 This package installs the prebuilt lerd binary published on each upstream
 release. Run "lerd install" once after installing to set up the stack.
